> I think the last thing Nethack needs is more classes.

If you had to get rid of three classes, which would they be?

My choices:
 - Caveman; he's just a Barb with bad weapon proficiencies.
 - Samurai; not different enough from Valk.
 - Tourist; has never really belonged.

I'd also make some changes to other classes...
 - Archeologist: Give him the Tourist's camera and MM scrolls.
 - Barbarian: Give him the Caveman's eating abilities.  Differentiate 
from Valk by slightly improving starting STR at the expense of CON (see 
stat-343.txt), and by adjusting weapon proficiencies.
 - Healer: To make him weaker so Tourist players will have someplace to 
go, remove all but one of the starting !EH.  Then give him some darts, 
but half as many as the Tourist had, and only +1 instead of +2.  Also 
remove the stone to flesh spellbook because it doesn't make sense.
 - Valk: Improve starting CON to something like what the Samurai had, 
adjust weapon proficiencies to differentiate from Barb.  

